    "No Objective. Starting cards as posted under 'Starting(5)': Yavin 4: Massassi Throne Room (the starting location), Staging Areas, Insurrection, Strike Planning and Heading For The Medical Frigate (posted 'Head for Med Frigate'); several Effects start, so no single starting Effect is set. Total 60 as published.",
