    "Posted 'Hoth Docking Bay' dested Hoth: Echo Docking Bay; 'Hoth Echo Command Warroom' Hoth: Echo Command Center (War Room); 'Home 1 Warroom'/'Home 1 Docking Bay' Home One: War Room / Home One: Docking Bay; 'Yavin 4 Massassi Warroom' Yavin 4: Massassi War Room; 'Home 1' (Ships) Home One.",
    "The same list was posted twice; DeckTech 11382 is the duplicate ('Sorry this is on here twice.')."
